  "problem": "Which of the following is a $3\\times 1$ matrix?\n\n$$\nF=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}],\\,G=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{3} \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],\\,H=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
